<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Pretraining-Dynamics</title><link>https://jaehun.me/tags/pretraining-dynamics/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/tags/pretraining-dynamics/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[논문리뷰]: Memory Retrieval and Consolidation in Large Language Models through Function Tokens</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-memory-retrieval-and-consolidation-in-large-language-models-through-function-tokens/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-memory-retrieval-and-consolidation-in-large-language-models-through-function-tokens/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 20 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.08203v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="function-token-hypothesis-llm-기억-검색의-게이트는-왜-구두점과-개행인가"&gt;Function Token Hypothesis: LLM “기억 검색”의 게이트는 왜 구두점과 개행인가&lt;a href="#function-token-hypothesis-llm-%ea%b8%b0%ec%96%b5-%ea%b2%80%ec%83%89%ec%9d%98-%ea%b2%8c%ec%9d%b4%ed%8a%b8%eb%8a%94-%ec%99%9c-%ea%b5%ac%eb%91%90%ec%a0%90%ea%b3%bc-%ea%b0%9c%ed%96%89%ec%9d%b8%ea%b0%80" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="한-줄-요약-tldr"&gt;한 줄 요약 (TL;DR)&lt;a href="#%ed%95%9c-%ec%a4%84-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd-tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;이 논문은 LLM의 기억을 “feature의 재활성화(retrieval) + 학습을 통한 feature 확장(consolidation)”으로 정의하고, &lt;strong&gt;function token&lt;/strong&gt;(고빈도 토큰)이 추론 시점에 예측에 필요한 feature들을 문맥-조건부로 재점화하며, 사전학습에서는&lt;strong&gt;function→content&lt;/strong&gt;예측이 최적화를 지배해 feature 수를 키운다는&lt;strong&gt;Function Token Hypothesis&lt;/strong&gt; 를 정량(coverage/degree)·정성(reactivation trace)·인과(steering)·학습동학(loss decomposition)으로 엮어 제시한다. (근거: §1, Fig.1, §3.1, Tab.1, §3.2, Fig.6, Fig.7, §4.2, Fig.8, §4.3, Fig.9)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>